@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+# Entity Interface Shrink — Semantic-Free Contract
+
+## Checkpoint geometry vs semantic-free contract
+
+| Layer | Checkpoint geometry (compat shim) | Online / training contract |
+|---|---|---|
+| Vision (`perception.npz`) | `slot_count` from checkpoint field or inferred from head width (`bias.size // 4`). Current weights use **4** slots. | Publish `entity_id=slot_{i}` only. No color / class / category table. |
+| Policy (`policy.pt`) | `SmallPolicyConfig.entity_count` from checkpoint (current weights **16**). | `build_entity_features(..., max_entities=config.entity_count)` pads/truncates a variable visible set. |
+| Bridge | `max_entities` runtime cap (default 32) | Unrelated to vision/policy tensor width. |
+
+**4 and 16 are not business assumptions.** They are tensor shapes baked into existing weights. Variable set-based vision/policy requires retrain (out of scope for this phase).
+
+## Naming contract
+
+- **TaskText**: natural-language ROS task sentence
+- **Instruction**: Qwen `Instruct:` domain string (`DEFAULT_INSTRUCTION`)
+- **entity_id (online)**: anonymous `slot_0..slot_{N-1}`
+- **Semantics**: only in `task_embedding` + per-entity `entity_embedding[64]`
+- **Manifest (data only)**:
+  - `vision.slot_entity_ids`: opaque UE simulator IDs supervising head slot `i`
+  - `teacher.follow_slot_index` / `standoff_m` / `embedding_key`: teacher labels without Python color parse
+
+## Migration
+
+```bash
+python scripts/backfill_manifest_slots.py --episodes data/episodes/moving_target_valid
+```
+
+Semantic RED/BLUE → slot index mapping exists **only** in that script.
+
+## Export
+
+`export_moving_target_bag.py` writes `teacher` / `vision` from explicit CLI args (or first-frame entity order). It does not invent color/`is_target` from `entity_id` substrings.
