+# Refactor Plan Notes — Semantic-Free Entities
+
+Status: **implemented in code, no retrain this phase.**
+
+## Done
+
+1. Vision: removed `ENTITY_IDS`; decode `slot_i`; `slot_count` from checkpoint / state_dict.
+2. Policy: removed module `ENTITY_COUNT`; `max_entities` from loaded `SmallPolicyConfig.entity_count`.
+3. Training: manifest `teacher` + `vision` drive supervision; no `task_key` / color heads / `scenario_from_slot`.
+4. Export: passthrough UE fields; write teacher/vision contracts.
+5. Backfill: `scripts/backfill_manifest_slots.py` for historical episodes.
+6. Static grep guard tests in training + Jetson packages.
+
+## Explicitly deferred (needs retrain)
+
+- Set-based / variable-N vision head
+- Dynamic policy entity graph / variable-length attention
+- UE simulator ID anonymization
